{"3081510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gang of Frogs", "steam_appid": 3081510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras/3772d07c61cd427eff75b7e3293ac05a.poster.avif?t=1783689157\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras/3772d07c61cd427eff75b7e3293ac05a.webm?t=1783689157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras/b8ee50066f77d0167390989ee816bca7.avif?t=1783689157\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras_big/b8ee50066f77d0167390989ee816bca7.avif?t=1783689157 width=800 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras/665c322e71314a50bdc739096018e882.avif?t=1783689157\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras_big/665c322e71314a50bdc739096018e882.avif?t=1783689157 width=800 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras/1db93ec0ec681b23ef7ca5bbf740e1c7.poster.avif?t=1783689157\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras/1db93ec0ec681b23ef7ca5bbf740e1c7.webm?t=1783689157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras/1db93ec0ec681b23ef7ca5bbf740e1c7.mp4?t=1783689157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a fearless frog outlaw and sail across the stars with your Gang of Frogs in a wild universe. Fight off hordes of monsters, explore strange civilizations, and uncover valuable loot hidden in ancient ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras/91b95493d05939d1ffdbebfc987cd773.avif?t=1783689157\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras_big/91b95493d05939d1ffdbebfc987cd773.avif?t=1783689157 width=800 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras/94288b374c0ed1af849309c3ada321ec.poster.avif?t=1783689157\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras/94288b374c0ed1af849309c3ada321ec.webm?t=1783689157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras/94288b374c0ed1af849309c3ada321ec.mp4?t=1783689157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your friends or tackle the galaxy solo as you explore hand-crafted worlds full of danger and surprises. Each character’s unique abilities add chaos and style to every battle. Hop from one mission to the next in your trusty sailboat and blast through waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras/d752788dc5c46ecb54d759bd8ae319fc.avif?t=1783689157\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras_big/d752788dc5c46ecb54d759bd8ae319fc.avif?t=1783689157 width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras/cec61d410ea71babf89f033168befb50.poster.avif?t=1783689157\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras/cec61d410ea71babf89f033168befb50.webm?t=1783689157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras/cec61d410ea71babf89f033168befb50.mp4?t=1783689157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gang of Frogs</i> mixes quick, fluid combat with deep progression. Gear up your frog crew with powerful loot, unlock skill upgrades, and upgrade your gear to become the biggest, baddest frog in the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras/01c9c67361e0b54bcb2d65ee96509fa5.avif?t=1783689157\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras_big/01c9c67361e0b54bcb2d65ee96509fa5.avif?t=1783689157 width=800 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras/fd4adea700496e428fc202b586d3e8eb.avif?t=1783689157\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3081510/extras_big/fd4adea700496e428fc202b586d3e8eb.avif?t=1783689157 width=800 height=352 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video c